enter\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Willie.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Willie</strong>: Hiho <i>Player</i>. I hope you are here to <b>trade</b>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trade</b><br/>\nWillie: Ya take a good look.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>god</b><br/>\nWillie: I am a farmer, not a preacher.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>help</b><br/>\nWillie: Help yourself. Or ask the other <b>citizens</b>, I don't have time for that.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>citizens</b><br/>\nWillie: Which one?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nWillie: I am a farmer and a cook.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>cook</b><br/>\nWillie: I try out old and new <b>recipes</b>. You can sell all <b>food</b> to me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>food</b><br/>\nWillie: Haven't they taught you anything at school? Ask for a <b>trade</b> if you want to trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>recipes</b><br/>\nWillie: I'd love to try a banana pie but I lack the <b>bananas</b>. If you get me one, I'll reward you.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>banana</b><br/>\nWillie: Have you found a banana for me?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nWillie: A banana! Great. Here, take this shield, I don't need it anyway.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nWillie: Are you trying to mess with me?!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>no</b><br/>\nWillie: Too bad.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nWillie: Willie.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nWillie: Do I look like a clock?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nWillie: I'm glad that we don't see many officials here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>magic</b><br/>\nWillie: I am magician in the kitchen.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Tibia</b><br/>\nWillie: If I were you, I'd stay here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>sell</b><br/>\nWillie: Haven't they taught you anything at school? Ask for a <b>trade</b> if you want to trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>buy</b><br/>\nWillie: Haven't they taught you anything at school? Ask for a <b>trade</b> if you want to trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>spell</b><br/>\nWillie: I know how to spell.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>weapon</b><br/>\nWillie: I'm not in the weapon business, so stop disturbing me.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dungeon</b><br/>\nWillie: I have no time for your dungeon nonsense.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>monsters</b><br/>\nWillie: Are you afraid of monsters? I bet even the sight of a <b>rat</b> would let your knees tremble. Hahaha.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>rat</b><br/>\nWilli: My cousin <b>Billy</b> cooks rat stew. Yuck! Can you imagine that?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Amber\">Amber</a></b><br/>\nWillie: Quite a babe.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Billy\">Billy</a></b><br/>\nWillie: Don't ever mention his name again! He can't even <b>cook</b>!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Cipfried\">Cipfried</a></b><br/>\nWillie: Our little monkey.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Dallheim\">Dallheim</a></b><br/>\nWillie: Uhm, fine guy I think.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Obi\">Obi</a></b><br/>\nWillie: This old guy has only money on his mind.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Seymour\">Seymour</a></b><br/>\nWillie: This joke of a man thinks he is sooo important.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nWillie: Yeah, bye <i>player</i>.<br/></p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Willie</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["studded-shield-quest"],"pos":{"x":32067,"y":32204,"z":7}}